</div>
<div id="u-credit-00148-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wors-obrine" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4888797); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4888797&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608474112" alt="WOrs Obrine" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4888797)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wors-obrine" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4888797); return false;">WOrs Obrine</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588569264 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">04 May 2020 05:14</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00380/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>外观为一███公司生产的█型机械闹钟。此闹钟将于设定时间的前5分钟敲响。使用者将会关掉闹钟并产生“再睡5分钟”的想法并继续睡1~3小时。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/07/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr Lamp寝室内<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于低风险异常物品收容柜中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>这个家伙让我错过了站点会议，我的全勤奖没了！——Dr Lamp</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00380" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00380" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00380-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-lamp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6508171); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6508171&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608474112" alt="Dr Lamp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6508171)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-lamp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6508171); return false;">Dr Lamp</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1598615386 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Aug 2020 11:49</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00149/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个素描用的石膏几何体，任何看见它的人（包括试图对它进行几何分析的机器）都会认为该项目是一个<strong>正七面体</strong>，尽管他们承认三维空间内不可能存在正七面体。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>中国某画室内。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被保存在Site-CN-57的一个保险箱中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>这根本不符合几何规律！但它看起来确实是一个正七面体！它的每个面都是正██边形，每条边成██°夹角？emmmm&#8230;难道不是吗？——研究员O████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00149" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00149" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00149-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6127045); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6127045&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608474112" alt="Dr Fishbone" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6127045)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6127045); return false;">Dr Fishbone</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588650319 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">05 May 2020 03:45</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
